        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jaryd Lazar, Summit1g\n- Products: PlayerUnknown's Battlegrounds, PUBG\n- Companies: PUBG Corp., Bluehole\n- Topics: Game streaming, Battle royale games\n\nFacts:\n- In March 2017, Jaryd Lazar, known as Summit1g, switched to streaming PlayerUnknown's Battlegrounds after the game's pre-release.\n- PlayerUnknown's Battlegrounds, also called PUBG, is a multiplayer online battle royale video game.\n- PUBG Corp. developed and published PlayerUnknown's Battlegrounds.\n- PUBG Corp. is a subsidiary of the Korean publisher Bluehole.",
